httpCall is operation
httpCall purpose "Run an http target by its place among them (1 parseRequest, 2 header, 3 response, 4 serializeResponse): 0, or an error's variant number with its payload stored"
httpCall invariant runsHttp "\"Each target reads and writes what host.py's http handlers read and write, malformed and absent included\""
